      "content": "wait, i think you might have gotten the apa one slightly wrong? i thought for apa 7th you just use \"et al.\" right from the first citation if there are 3 or more authors. could you double check that for me? and also, can you show me exactly what the parenthesis would look like for both if the first author is Smith?",
